Dispose Me - Cloudflare

make setup              Install pinned dependencies on a fresh checkout
make start              Migrate the local database and start Wrangler
make build              Compile Tailwind CSS and EJS templates
make clean              Remove dependencies and generated build artifacts
make fmt                Format application code and Terraform
make config             Generate deployment configuration from R2 Terraform state
make infra args="..."   Run state/storage/routing Terraform commands using the R2 backend
make deploy             Apply schema migrations, deploy Worker code, and upload its secret
make deploy args="--dry-run"  Build the provisioned deployment without remote mutations
make deploy environment=PATH  Deploy from another environment's checkout and R2 configuration
make test               Run all CI verification checks
make test/lint          Check application formatting and lint
make test/unit          Run business-logic and deployment-tool tests
make test/worker        Typecheck and dry-run the Worker bundle
make test/integration   Exercise email-to-inbox behavior in the local Workers runtime
make test/infra         Validate Terraform and execute mocked infrastructure tests
